  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, heat 1/2 the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Add basmati rice, water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt, stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634c8020561750610e0c4a33/step-3dd8f1f2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the rice has 10 minutes remaining, roughly chop tomato. Drain chickpeas.\n• In a small heatproof bowl, combine 1/2 the garlic paste and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Microwave, in 10 second bursts, until fragrant. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634c8020561750610e0c4a33/step-7a833e3a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Add tomato, chickpeas, tomato paste (see ingredients), mild curry paste, Mumbai spice blend and the remaining garlic paste and butter, cook stirring, until softened and fragrant, 3-4 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634c8020561750610e0c4a33/step-1d8cbd8f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium and stir in thickened cream, the water (for the curry) and the brown sugar, cook until combined and slightly reduced, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add baby spinach leaves, cook, stirring, until slightly wilted, 1 minute. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634c8020561750610e0c4a33/step-3a542370.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, preheat grill to high. Brush garlic oil over one side of the naan.\n• Place naan directly on an oven wire rack and bake until golden, 3-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634c8020561750610e0c4a33/step-b0c99601.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the rice, add roasted cashew nuts, stirring to combine.\n• Divide buttered-cashew rice between bowls.\n• Spoon over creamy chickpea, tomato and spinach curry.\n• Top with Greek style yoghurt. Serve with garlic naan. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634c8020561750610e0c4a33/step-e39c7af4.jpg"
    }
  ]
